{
  "name": "client",
  "description": "Countdown Timer",
  "config": {
    "project": {
      "name": "jactastic",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "description": "Jac client application: jactastic",
      "entry-point": "main.jac"
    },
    "dependencies": {
      "npm": {
        "jac-client-node": "1.0.7",
        "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.1.17",
        "tailwindcss": "^4.1.17",
        "dev": {
          "@jac-client/dev-deps": "2.0.0"
        }
      }
    },
    "dev-dependencies": {
      "watchdog": ">=3.0.0"
    },
    "plugins": {
      "client": {
        "vite": {
          "plugins": [
            "tailwindcss()"
          ],
          "lib_imports": [
            "import tailwindcss from '@tailwindcss/vite'"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "serve": {
      "base_route_app": "app"
    }
  },
  "files": {
    "README.md": "# Jactastic \u2014 Countdown Timer\n\nA single-page countdown timer built with Jac client components (React under the hood) and Tailwind CSS v4.\n\nThe UI is a dark, glassy countdown with animated bokeh particles and four circular progress rings (days / hours / minutes / seconds). You can change the target date from the in-app editor.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nbuild/jactastic/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 jac.toml                          # Project config + npm deps (Tailwind + @tailwindcss/vite)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 main.jac                          # App entry point (renders CountdownApp)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 components/\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 CountdownApp.cl.jac            # Countdown UI + reactive state\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 styles/\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 global.css                    # Tailwind import + app-specific gradients/animations\n```\n\n## Run\n\nFrom this directory:\n\n```bash\njac start main.jac\n```\n\n## What To Edit\n\n- **Default target date**: update `target_year`, `target_month`, `target_day` in `components/CountdownApp.cl.jac`.\n- **Styling**:\n  - Tailwind is enabled (see `styles/global.css` with `@import \"tailwindcss\";` and `jac.toml` Vite plugin config).\n  - App-specific visuals (gradients, bokeh animation, typography tweaks) live in `styles/global.css`.\n\n## Jac Patterns Used\n\n**Reactive state** (`has` fields):\n\n```jac\nhas days: int = 0;\nhas editing: bool = False;\n```\n\n**Effect-like ability with cleanup** (`can with [...] entry`):\n\n```jac\ncan with [target_year, target_month, target_day] entry {\n    def tick -> None { /* recompute countdown */ }\n    tick();\n    id = setInterval(tick, 1000);\n\n    def cleanup -> None { clearInterval(id); }\n    return cleanup;\n}\n```\n\n**List rendering** (comprehension):\n\n```jac\n{[<div key={p[\"id\"]} /> for p in particles]}\n```\n\n## Adding npm Dependencies\n\n```bash\njac add --cl <package-name>\n```\n",
    "main.jac": "\"\"\"Countdown timer \u2014 Winter 2026.\"\"\"\n\ncl import from .components.countdownApp { CountdownApp }\ncl import \".styles.global.css\";\n\ncl {\n    def:pub app() -> JsxElement {\n        return <CountdownApp />;\n    }\n}\n",
    "components/countdownApp.cl.jac": "\"\"\"Countdown timer component \u2014 circular dot-ring style.\"\"\"\n\ndef:pub CountdownApp() -> JsxElement {\n    has target_year: int = 2026;\n    has target_month: int = 12;\n    has target_day: int = 31;\n    has editing: bool = False;\n    has days: int = 0;\n    has hours: int = 0;\n    has minutes: int = 0;\n    has seconds: int = 0;\n    \n    can with [target_year, target_month, target_day] entry {\n        def tick() -> None {\n            mo = str(target_month) if target_month >= 10 else \"0\" + str(target_month);\n            dy = str(target_day) if target_day >= 10 else \"0\" + str(target_day);\n            target = Date.parse(str(target_year) + \"-\" + mo + \"-\" + dy + \"T00:00:00\");\n            diff = target - Date.now();\n            if diff > 0 {\n                days = Math.floor(diff / 86400000);\n                hours = Math.floor((diff % 86400000) / 3600000);\n                minutes = Math.floor((diff % 3600000) / 60000);\n                seconds = Math.floor((diff % 60000) / 1000);\n            } else {\n                days = 0;\n                hours = 0;\n                minutes = 0;\n                seconds = 0;\n            }\n        }\n        tick();\n        id = setInterval(tick, 1000);\n\n        def cleanup() -> None {\n            clearInterval(id);\n        }\n\n        return cleanup;\n    }\n\n    circ: float = 477.52;\n    days_arc: str = str(days / 365.0 * circ) + \" \" + str(circ);\n    hours_arc: str = str(hours / 24.0 * circ) + \" \" + str(circ);\n    minutes_arc: str = str(minutes / 60.0 * circ) + \" \" + str(circ);\n    seconds_arc: str = str(seconds / 60.0 * circ) + \" \" + str(circ);\n\n    def pad2(n: int) -> str {\n        s = str(n);\n        if len(s) < 2 {\n            return \"0\" + s;\n        }\n        return s;\n    }\n\n    def dec_year() -> None {\n        target_year = target_year - 1;\n    }\n\n    def inc_year() -> None {\n        target_year = target_year + 1;\n    }\n\n    def dec_month() -> None {\n        target_month = target_month - 1 if target_month > 1 else 12;\n    }\n\n    def inc_month() -> None {\n        target_month = target_month + 1 if target_month < 12 else 1;\n    }\n\n    def dec_day() -> None {\n        target_day = target_day - 1 if target_day > 1 else 31;\n    }\n\n    def inc_day() -> None {\n        target_day = target_day + 1 if target_day < 31 else 1;\n    }\n\n    def start_editing() -> None {\n        editing = True;\n    }\n\n    def stop_editing() -> None {\n        editing = False;\n    }\n\n    def particle_for(pid: int) -> dict {\n        size: int = 12 + ((pid * 23) % 79);\n        left_pct: int = 3 + ((pid * 31) % 91);\n        top_pct: int = 8 + ((pid * 47) % 83);\n\n        delay_halves: int = (pid * 3) % 13;  # 0..6.0 in 0.5 steps\n        delay_s: float = delay_halves / 2.0;\n        dur_s: float = 8.0 + float((pid * 5) % 10);\n\n        opacity: float = 0.06 + float((pid * 13) % 25) / 100.0;\n        blur_px: int = 3 + ((pid * 7) % 23);\n\n        return {\n            \"id\": pid,\n            \"size\": size,\n            \"left\": str(left_pct) + \"%\",\n            \"top\": str(top_pct) + \"%\",\n            \"delay\": str(delay_s) + \"s\",\n            \"dur\": str(dur_s) + \"s\",\n            \"opacity\": opacity,\n            \"filter\": \"blur(\" + str(blur_px) + \"px)\",\n\n        };\n    }\n\n    particle_count: int = 18;\n    particles: list = [];\n    pid: int = 1;\n    while pid <= particle_count {\n        particles.append(particle_for(pid));\n        pid += 1;\n    }\n\n    return\n        <div\n            className=\"cd-app relative w-screen h-screen flex flex-col overflow-hidden\"\n        >\n            <div className=\"cd-bokeh absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\">\n                {[\n                    <div\n                        key={p[\"id\"]}\n                        className=\"cd-particle absolute rounded-full\"\n                        style={{\n                            \"width\": p[\"size\"],\n                            \"height\": p[\"size\"],\n                            \"left\": p[\"left\"],\n                            \"top\": p[\"top\"],\n                            \"opacity\": p[\"opacity\"],\n                            \"filter\": p[\"filter\"],\n                            \"animationDelay\": p[\"delay\"],\n                            \"animationDuration\": p[\"dur\"],\n\n                        }}\n                    /> for p in particles\n                ]}\n            </div>\n            <div\n                className=\"cd-content relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-1 gap-9\"\n            >\n                <div className=\"cd-title-row flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                    <h1 className=\"cd-title\">\n                        COUNTDOWN TIMER\n                    </h1>\n                </div>\n                {editing\n                and <div className=\"cd-editor flex flex-col items-center\">\n                    <div className=\"cd-editor-label\">\n                        TARGET DATE\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"cd-editor-fields flex items-end gap-[10px]\">\n                        <div className=\"cd-field flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span className=\"cd-field-label\">\n                                YEAR\n                            </span>\n                            <div\n                                className=\"cd-stepper flex items-center overflow-hidden\"\n                            >\n                                <button className=\"cd-step-btn\" onClick={dec_year}>\n                                    \u2212\n                                </button>\n                                <span className=\"cd-step-val\">\n                                    {target_year}\n                                </span>\n                                <button className=\"cd-step-btn\" onClick={inc_year}>\n                                    +\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"cd-field-sep\">\n                            /\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"cd-field flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span className=\"cd-field-label\">\n                                MONTH\n                            </span>\n                            <div\n                                className=\"cd-stepper flex items-center overflow-hidden\"\n                            >\n                                <button className=\"cd-step-btn\" onClick={dec_month}>\n                                    \u2212\n                                </button>\n                                <span className=\"cd-step-val\">\n                                    {pad2(target_month)}\n                                </span>\n                                <button className=\"cd-step-btn\" onClick={inc_month}>\n                                    +\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"cd-field-sep\">\n                            /\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"cd-field flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span className=\"cd-field-label\">\n                                DAY\n                            </span>\n                            <div\n                                className=\"cd-stepper flex items-center overflow-hidden\"\n                            >\n                                <button className=\"cd-step-btn\" onClick={dec_day}>\n                                    \u2212\n                                </button>\n                                <span className=\"cd-step-val\">\n                                    {pad2(target_day)}\n                                </span>\n                                <button className=\"cd-step-btn\" onClick={inc_day}>\n                                    +\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <button className=\"cd-done-btn\" onClick={stop_editing}>\n                        DONE\n                    </button>\n                </div>}\n                <div className=\"cd-timer-block\">\n                    <div className=\"cd-rings-row flex items-start gap-9\">\n                        <div className=\"cd-ring-item flex flex-col items-center gap-3.5\">\n                            <div className=\"cd-ring-wrap relative w-[180px] h-[180px]\">\n                                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\">\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"rgba(0,180,220,0.15)\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                    />\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"#00aaff\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                        strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n                                        strokeDasharray={days_arc}\n                                        transform=\"rotate(-90 90 90)\"\n                                    />\n                                </svg>\n                                <span\n                                    className=\"cd-ring-num absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\"\n                                >\n                                    {days}\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span className=\"cd-ring-label\">\n                                DAYS\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"cd-ring-item flex flex-col items-center gap-3.5\">\n                            <div className=\"cd-ring-wrap relative w-[180px] h-[180px]\">\n                                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\">\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"rgba(0,180,220,0.15)\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                    />\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"#00aaff\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                        strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n                                        strokeDasharray={hours_arc}\n                                        transform=\"rotate(-90 90 90)\"\n                                    />\n                                </svg>\n                                <span\n                                    className=\"cd-ring-num absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\"\n                                >\n                                    {hours}\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span className=\"cd-ring-label\">\n                                HOURS\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"cd-ring-item flex flex-col items-center gap-3.5\">\n                            <div className=\"cd-ring-wrap relative w-[180px] h-[180px]\">\n                                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\">\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"rgba(0,180,220,0.15)\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                    />\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"#00aaff\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                        strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n                                        strokeDasharray={minutes_arc}\n                                        transform=\"rotate(-90 90 90)\"\n                                    />\n                                </svg>\n                                <span\n                                    className=\"cd-ring-num absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\"\n                                >\n                                    {minutes}\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span className=\"cd-ring-label\">\n                                MINUTES\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div\n                            className=\"cd-ring-item flex flex-col items-center gap-3.5\"\n                        >\n                            <div className=\"cd-ring-wrap relative w-[180px] h-[180px]\">\n                                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\">\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"rgba(0,180,220,0.15)\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                    />\n                                    <circle\n                                        cx=\"90\"\n                                        cy=\"90\"\n                                        r=\"76\"\n                                        fill=\"none\"\n                                        stroke=\"#00aaff\"\n                                        strokeWidth=\"6\"\n                                        strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n                                        strokeDasharray={seconds_arc}\n                                        transform=\"rotate(-90 90 90)\"\n                                    />\n                                </svg>\n                                <span\n                                    className=\"cd-ring-num absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\"\n                                >\n                                    {seconds}\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span className=\"cd-ring-label\">\n                                SECONDS\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div\n                        className=\"btn-wrapper flex justify-center items-center h-[120px]\"\n                    >\n                        <button\n                            className=\"cd-change-btn\"\n                            type=\"button\"\n                            onClick={start_editing}\n                        >\n                            Change timer\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>;\n}\n",
    "styles/global.css": "@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\nhtml, body {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: #080a10;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n/* \u2500\u2500 App shell \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */\n.cd-app {\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, #111828 0%, #090c18 55%, #060810 100%);\n}\n\n/* \u2500\u2500 Bokeh layer \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */\n.cd-particle {\n  background: radial-gradient(\n    circle,\n    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) 0%,\n    rgba(200, 215, 255, 0.5) 40%,\n    transparent 72%\n  );\n  animation: bokeh-drift ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n\n@keyframes bokeh-drift {\n  0%   { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }\n  33%  { transform: translate(10px, -18px) scale(1.04); }\n  66%  { transform: translate(-12px, -8px) scale(0.97); }\n  100% { transform: translate(6px, 14px) scale(1.02); }\n}\n\n.cd-title {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);\n  letter-spacing: 9px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.cd-change-btn {\n  appearance: none;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 2.6px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;\n}\n\n.cd-change-btn:hover {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.cd-change-btn:active {\n  transform: translateY(0px);\n}\n\n.cd-edit-btn {\n  width: 30px;\n  height: 30px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);\n  background: transparent;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, background 0.2s;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.cd-edit-btn:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.65);\n  color: #00d4ff;\n  background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n/* \u2500\u2500 Date editor panel \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */\n.cd-editor {\n  gap: 18px;\n  background: rgba(6, 14, 30, 0.75);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.18);\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  padding: 22px 36px 20px;\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.06);\n}\n\n.cd-editor-label {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  letter-spacing: 4.5px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.cd-field-label {\n  font-size: 9px;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.cd-stepper {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.18);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.cd-step-btn {\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 40px;\n  border: none;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.75);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  user-select: none;\n  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;\n}\n.cd-step-btn:hover {\n  background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.12);\n  color: #00e8ff;\n}\n.cd-step-btn:active {\n  background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.22);\n}\n\n.cd-step-val {\n  min-width: 54px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 17px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  border-left: 1px solid rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.12);\n  border-right: 1px solid rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.12);\n  height: 40px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.cd-field-sep {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n  font-weight: 200;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  padding-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.cd-done-btn {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #006fcc 0%, #00c4a0 100%);\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  padding: 11px 40px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.15s;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.cd-done-btn:hover {\n  opacity: 0.85;\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n.cd-done-btn:active {\n  transform: translateY(0);\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.cd-ring-num {\n  font-size: 54px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  line-height: 1;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.cd-ring-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);\n  letter-spacing: 3.5px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n/* \u2500\u2500 Crown \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */\n.cd-crown {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 22px;\n  left: 22px;\n  font-size: 26px;\n  z-index: 10;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n/* \u2500\u2500 Scrollbar (hidden) \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 */\n::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n"
  },
  "directories": [],
  "root_gitignore_entries": [
    "packages/",
    "*.jbc",
    "*.jir",
    "__pycache__/",
    "*.py[cod]",
    ".venv/",
    "venv/",
    ".idea/",
    ".vscode/",
    "*.swp",
    "node_modules/",
    ".jac/",
    "*.session",
    "*.session.*"
  ]
}